      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marbleton%2C_Wyoming"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Big Piney Garage, which opened around 1912, was the first garage to open in town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
