      ],
      "source": "https://www.wyohistory.org/encyclopedia/big-piney-and-marbleton-wyoming"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1879, cattle drivers were forced to move their livestock to South Piney Creek to wait out an early winter.",
